source: crates/instrukt-cli/tests/cases/harness.rs
expression: help
---
Inspect keyed runtime threads and resolve uncertain unattended starts

Usage: instrukt sessions <COMMAND>

Commands:
  list             List this project's active and settled runtime threads, newest activity first
  resolve-start    Resolve a pending start by verifying a thread or allowing a fresh start
  replace-deleted  Confirm a deleted thread's provider stopped and start its replacement
  help             Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
  -h, --help     Print help
  -V, --version  Print version
